      "description": "<p>The innkeeper knows how to settle fights that break out. When the innkeeper is fighting in their establishment, their Strikes gain a +1 circumstance bonus to the attack roll, deal an additional 1d4 damage, and gain the nonlethal trait if they don't already have it. The innkeeper can choose not to gain this benefit.</p>",
